com,"$Paskert hit a groundball that deflected off 3Bman Herzog"
com,"and then struck baserunner Bescher. The ball bounced away"
com,"allowing Bescher to score and Paskert to reach 2nd. Boston"
com,"argued that Bescher should be declared out but umpires"
com,"ruled that since Herzog had a chance to field the ball"
com,"Bescher is not out."
